// tile_trace.vlt -- Verilator configuration file for the activity-power pilot (plan power-pilot-plan.md 1.2).
// Purpose: keep waveform tracing (FST) to the synthesized BoomTile instead of the whole TestHarness.
// Input  : none (plain Verilator config; patterns match the hierarchical scope names of the model).
// Usage  : passed to the sim build as an extra source, together with --trace-underscore:
//            make -j20 debug CONFIG=BaselineBoomPowerDMIConfig VERILATOR_THREADS=20 NUMACTL=1 USE_FST=1 \
//              EXTRA_SIM_SOURCES="--trace-underscore $CY/tools/ooc-synth/power/tile_trace.vlt"
// Note   : that a later `tracing_on -scope` re-enables tracing inside the global `tracing_off` is an assumption
//          (plan 1.2, risk 3); step S0 checks the FST hierarchy.  fst2saif cuts the scope anyway.
`verilator_config
tracing_off
tracing_on -scope "*element_reset_domain_boom_tile*"
